#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:5
#: 5ee46b4123b74a769745479ca18c72b6
msgid "ESP32 WiFi telemetry - DroneBridge"
msgstr "ESP32 WiFi 数传 - DroneBridge"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:7
#: a24f53401fb84c1fadd4d530c4fa71b5
msgid ""
"ESP32 are readily available Wi-Fi modules with full TCP/IP stack and "
"microcontroller capability. They offer dedicated UART, SPI and I2C "
"interfaces."
msgstr "ESP32 是随手可得的 WiFi 模块，具有完整的 TCP/IP 协议栈和微控制器能力，提供专用的 UART、SPI 和 I2C 接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:11
#: 1e76b75fd9374a939cc4bfee4087b3de
msgid ""
"**DroneBridge for ESP32** for the popular ESP32 modules from Espressif "
"Systems offers a transparent and bi-directional serial  to WiFi bridge. In "
"addition it features a custom ESP-NOW implementation which allows for ranges"
" of up to 1km. It is one of the cheapest ways to communicate with ardupilot "
"wirelessly."
msgstr ""
"**DroneBridge for ESP32** 专为 Espressif Systems 的热门 ESP32 模块打造，提供透明的双向串口转 "
"WiFi 桥接。此外，它还具有自定义 ESP-NOW 实现，通信距离可达 1km。这是与 ArduPilot 进行无线通信最经济实惠的方式之一。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:13
#: 302bbc1deaa74c91a14b5bc75c99758f
msgid ""
"It also allows for a fully transparent serial to WiFi pass-through link with"
" variable packet size.| DroneBridge for ESP32 is a telemetry/low data rate-"
"only solution. There is no support for cameras connected to the ESP32 since "
"it does not support video encoding."
msgstr ""
"它还支持可变数据包大小的完全透明串口转 WiFi 直通链路。| DroneBridge for ESP32 "
"是一种仅适用于数传/低速数据传输的解决方案，不支持连接到 ESP32 的摄像头，因为它不支持视频编码。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:9
#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:-1
#: 07389729d6184a6ba545de55a46c345a 4e3ad8ba9c70433b9902d6b3ed4e88f7
#: 71434b391b2f4a3da6bc48bbc7bafa1e c387309bd5d948e686289b7c52b49aca
#: e318ecc5914e4012b81b2a5f06672e4d e793618ebbf84c7fbacc5d0fae0222ba
msgid "DroneBridge for ESP32 and WiFi connections"
msgstr "DroneBridge for ESP32 与 WiFi 连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:13
#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:18
#: 3841741efe3e416abff6722a29455a0f 7ab3f75bf30748889693ea0d0f9c7a3f
#: 7bd09ec1452240b0a7ec730ef32760e5 7f1b7a12b58c4ad7a6207bc9b6542128
#: a0a4ea510fcf4f4ab7626b90d7c55c3c ec786b1651204dd9926618e70ff67865
msgid ""
"DroneBridge for ESP32 supports standard WiFi connections to an access point "
"but can also operate as a standalone access point."
msgstr "DroneBridge for ESP32 支持连接到标准 WiFi 接入点，也可以作为独立热点运行。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:15
#: ../../source/docs/common-esp32-telemetry.rst:-1
#: 090f2efd581746e398970245963924cb 0d92e114376249d79ddfe5ccc038629f
#: 26357af6f8614fdd8df0eed478ec3515 4be392c463f94baf92cd0d2a129359cc
